      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{66cda7261ec168f0bdef34fa|full_name} I represent some communication at Virtual Market, and in short there are licenses with commercial companies. These companies sponsor and pay for the event. \n\nBeing able to use a sticker to cover up important information or things like that that change the experience in a negative or defamatory way going viral can be a problem. \n\nSanrio and others require avatars (mochipoly) for that reason and we've had events that are similar. Unfortunately, I agree with this canny. World creators must be able to create the intended experience, commercial or not.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
