      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "A better analogy is actually, that your world upload is a blueprint, and anyone can build the blueprint, if they build the blueprint publically you get to enforce some rules.\n\nIf the blueprint is built in private you don't get to see the result, and therefore shouldn't have the power to enforce any rules on it.",
