      "value": "@{66cda7261ec168f0bdef34fa|full_name} Japan's law differs significantly, however. I'm not a lawyer, but it's my understand that while that might work in the USA, it doesn't work there, which is why people from Japan are the ones concerned. Japan's defamation laws prevent things like \"unauthorized modification\" that can cover things. I think they're being cautious.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
